    "text": "The program builds an initial schedule while simulating traffic, then improves it by hill climbing until about 8.3 seconds have passed.\n\n**1. Which streets get a light.** Only streets that some car must leave through are put into a schedule. That means every street on a car's path except the last one. Every other street stays red, which costs nothing.\n\n**2. Initial schedule.**\n- Each intersection's cycle has one second per used incoming street.\n- The order of streets in the cycle is decided during a first simulation. When a car arrives at a street that has no slot yet, the street takes the first free slot at or after the current time within the cycle. The aim is that the light tends to be green when the first car arrives.\n- Streets that no car reached in that simulation fill the remaining slots.\n\n**3. Fast simulation.** Cars are processed in arrival order using one bucket per second, so each simulation is linear in the total path length.\n- A car leaves a street at the first green second that is at or after both its arrival time and one second after the previous car left. This captures the FIFO rule and the one-car-per-second limit.\n- Two cars can only reach the same street end at the same time at t = 0. There, input order decides who goes first, as the statement requires.\n- Waiting time is recorded per intersection.\n\n**4. Local search.**\n- Each step picks an intersection with at least two scheduled streets. The choice is weighted by how much waiting happened there.\n- The move either swaps two streets in the cycle, or changes one street's green duration by \u00b11 (kept between 1 and D).\n- A move is kept if the full re-simulated score is equal or better; otherwise it is undone.\n- The random generator has a fixed seed, so the output is deterministic.\n\n**5. Output.** Only intersections with a non-empty schedule are printed, and every duration stays within 1..D. This keeps the file within the statement's format rules.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint D,I,S,V,F;\nvector<int> B,E,L;\nvector<string> nm;\nvector<int> pathOff, pathData;\nvector<vector<int>> order_;\nvector<int> dur, off_, cyc;\nvector<char> inS;\nvector<int> lastDep;\nvector<long long> waitI;\nvector<vector<int>> buckets;\nvector<int> posC;\nconst int INF = INT_MAX/2;\n\nstatic inline int nextGreen(int s,int t){\n    if(!inS[s]) return INF;\n    int C=cyc[E[s]];\n    int r=t%C, o=off_[s], d=dur[s];\n    if(r>=o && r<o+d) return t;\n    int w=o-r; if(w<0) w+=C;\n    return t+w;\n}\n\nvoid recomputeInter(int i){\n    int o=0;\n    for(int s:order_[i]){ off_[s]=o; o+=dur[s]; }\n    cyc[i]=o;\n}\n\nlong long sim(bool assign, vector<vector<int>>* slots=nullptr, vector<char>* assigned=nullptr){\n    fill(lastDep.begin(),lastDep.end(),-1);\n    fill(waitI.begin(),waitI.end(),0);\n    for(int t=0;t<=D;t++) buckets[t].clear();\n    long long score=0;\n    for(int c=0;c<V;c++){ posC[c]=pathOff[c]; buckets[0].push_back(c); }\n    for(int t=0;t<D;t++){\n        auto &bk=buckets[t];\n        for(size_t k=0;k<bk.size();k++){\n            int c=bk[k];\n            int p=posC[c];\n            int s=pathData[p];\n            if(assign && !(*assigned)[s]){\n                int i=E[s]; int C=cyc[i];\n                int r=t%C;\n                auto &sl=(*slots)[i];\n                while(sl[r]!=-1){ r++; if(r==C) r=0; }\n                sl[r]=s; off_[s]=r; (*assigned)[s]=1;\n            }\n            int st=max(t,lastDep[s]+1);\n            int dep=nextGreen(s,st);\n            if(dep>=INF) continue;\n            waitI[E[s]]+=dep-t;\n            if(dep>D) continue;\n            lastDep[s]=dep;\n            p++;\n            int nx=pathData[p];\n            long long arr=(long long)dep+L[nx];\n            if(p==pathOff[c+1]-1){\n                if(arr<=D) score+=F+(D-arr);\n            } else {\n                if(arr<D){ posC[c]=p; buckets[arr].push_back(c); }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return score;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    auto T0=chrono::steady_clock::now();\n    auto elapsed=[&](){return chrono::duration<double>(chrono::steady_clock::now()-T0).count();};\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false); cin.tie(nullptr);\n    cin>>D>>I>>S>>V>>F;\n    B.resize(S);E.resize(S);L.resize(S);nm.resize(S);\n    unordered_map<string,int> mp; mp.reserve(S*2);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){ cin>>B[i]>>E[i]>>nm[i]>>L[i]; mp[nm[i]]=i; }\n    pathOff.resize(V+1);\n    for(int c=0;c<V;c++){\n        int P; cin>>P; pathOff[c]=pathData.size();\n        string x;\n        for(int j=0;j<P;j++){ cin>>x; pathData.push_back(mp[x]); }\n    }\n    pathOff[V]=pathData.size();\n    vector<int> cnt(S,0);\n    for(int c=0;c<V;c++) for(int p=pathOff[c];p<pathOff[c+1]-1;p++) cnt[pathData[p]]++;\n    order_.assign(I,{}); dur.assign(S,1); off_.assign(S,0); cyc.assign(I,0); inS.assign(S,0);\n    lastDep.assign(S,-1); waitI.assign(I,0); buckets.assign(D+1,{}); posC.assign(V,0);\n    vector<int> kcnt(I,0);\n    for(int s=0;s<S;s++) if(cnt[s]>0){ inS[s]=1; kcnt[E[s]]++; }\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++) cyc[i]=max(1,kcnt[i]);\n    vector<vector<int>> slots(I);\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++) slots[i].assign(kcnt[i],-1);\n    vector<char> assigned(S,0);\n    sim(true,&slots,&assigned);\n    for(int s=0;s<S;s++) if(inS[s] && !assigned[s]){\n        auto &sl=slots[E[s]];\n        for(auto &x:sl) if(x==-1){ x=s; break; }\n        assigned[s]=1;\n    }\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++){\n        order_[i]=slots[i];\n        recomputeInter(i);\n    }\n    long long cur=sim(false);\n    mt19937 rng(12345);\n    vector<int> cand; vector<long long> pref;\n    auto rebuild=[&](){\n        cand.clear(); pref.clear(); long long acc=0;\n        for(int i=0;i<I;i++) if(order_[i].size()>=2 && waitI[i]>0){\n            acc+=waitI[i]; cand.push_back(i); pref.push_back(acc);\n        }\n    };\n    rebuild();\n    vector<int> allMulti;\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++) if(order_[i].size()>=2) allMulti.push_back(i);\n    const double LIMIT=8.3;\n    if(!allMulti.empty()){\n        while(elapsed()<LIMIT){\n            int i;\n            if(!cand.empty() && (rng()%10)!=0){\n                long long x=(long long)(rng()%(unsigned long long)pref.back());\n                int idx=upper_bound(pref.begin(),pref.end(),x)-pref.begin();\n                i=cand[idx];\n            } else i=allMulti[rng()%allMulti.size()];\n            auto &ord=order_[i];\n            int k=ord.size();\n            int type=rng()%2;\n            int a=-1,b=-1,s=-1,delta=0;\n            if(type==0){\n                a=rng()%k; b=rng()%k; if(a==b) b=(a+1)%k;\n                swap(ord[a],ord[b]);\n            } else {\n                s=ord[rng()%k];\n                if(dur[s]>1 && (rng()%2)) delta=-1; else delta=1;\n                if(dur[s]+delta>D) delta=-1;\n                if(dur[s]+delta<1) continue;\n                dur[s]+=delta;\n            }\n            recomputeInter(i);\n            long long sc=sim(false);\n            if(sc>=cur){\n                cur=sc;\n                rebuild();\n            } else {\n                if(type==0) swap(ord[a],ord[b]);\n                else dur[s]-=delta;\n                recomputeInter(i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    // output\n    string out;\n    int A=0;\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++) if(!order_[i].empty()) A++;\n    out+=to_string(A)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int i=0;i<I;i++) if(!order_[i].empty()){\n        out+=to_string(i)+\"\\n\"+to_string(order_[i].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(int s:order_[i]){ out+=nm[s]; out+=' '; out+=to_string(dur[s]); out+='\\n'; }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
